<title>PAKISTAN: Bomb kills 12, including Sunni leader, in Pakistan.</title>
<headline>Bomb kills 12, including Sunni leader, in Pakistan.</headline>
<dateline>LAHORE, Pakistan 1997-01-18</dateline>
<text>
<p>Twelve people, including the leader of a militant Sunni Moslem group, were killed in a bomb explosion on Saturday in the Pakistani city of Lahore, hospital sources said.</p>
<p>They said Zia-ur-Rahman Faruqi, patron-in-chief of the Sipah-i-Sahaba Pakistan (SSP) group, was wounded in the blast outside a court along with his deputy, Azam Tariq, and died later in hospital.</p>
</text>
